	abstract = {We present a manifestly gauge-invariant description of Chern numbers associated with the Berry connection deﬁned on a discretized Brillouin zone. It provides an eﬃcient method of computing (spin) Hall conductances without specifying gauge-ﬁxing conditions. We demonstrate that it correctly reproduces quantized Hall conductances even on a coarsely discretized Brillouin zone. A gaugedependent integer-valued ﬁeld, which plays a key role in the formulation, is evaluated in several gauges. An extension to the non-Abelian Berry connection is also given.},
